          "en": "Sunday, 22 June",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "The notice about the dragon boat race finally came out last Friday. I was excited because my father was on a race team!",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "In the morning, my dad woke up early and went to the river. My mum and I went later and waited for the race. Then the judge counted down. The race began! I ran and cheered for my dad. His boat was very fast and his team won the race! They all sang their team song together. They were so happy!",
          "mp3": "",
          "cn": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "",
          "en": "In the evening, our family made zongzi and had a big dinner for the festival, and for the winner, my dad! It was the best Dragon Boat Festival ever!",
